BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tracing OEM Supply Chain Strategies in the EV Transition: Prelimin
 ary Evidence from Press Releases
DTSTART:20261013T130000Z
DTEND:20261013T133000Z
DTSTAMP:20261009T112400Z
UID:4ac4bf61def495f2eb9bf28c@systemsmap.antlerboy.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Complexity
DESCRIPTION:Complexity Science Hub\nThe transition to electric vehicles ch
 allenges incumbent automakers to rethink their strategies and supply chain
 s. In this talk\, Leonardo will present ongoing work on how established OE
